note('Author page 19 (circled); archive 37. Completes the geometric formula (67), introduces the companion path (66 prime), and writes (67 prime) with tilde sigma infinity. It then considers the eight-vertex subgroupoid VII and the five-vertex description VIII/IV. The written R_{i,omega} indexing is retained. The small left path has P infinity, although the main diagram has P without that subscript. The sphere VII required two directional corrections against C: the upper right small-circle arc and the left outer equatorial connection. The written count “24 flèches” is retained; no extra arrowheads are supplied to force that count on the rough sketch. The bottom says “on en donne pas en plus”, preserving its word order, and “en fait”. The final article is overwritten and remains la/le; the page ends with qui, continuing the sentence. No independent mathematical theorem check was made on this page.')
